# Data host for production builds: the qtlstore on Backblaze B2, behind cloud2.databio.org.
# `VITE_DATA_BASE= npm run build` (empty) makes a bundle that reads /data on its own origin, which
# is what `npm run preview` serves locally.
VITE_DATA_BASE=https://cloud2.databio.org/qtl-browser
# The study: an experiment id whose collection's experiments the app opens (the cis and trans scans
# of each phenotype type), and the GWAS experiment the landing track and gene page panel use.
VITE_COLLECTION_OF=topchef_ge_cis
VITE_GWAS=dcm_jurgens2024_biobanks
